   "narrative": "The player begins in Main Stage 16 Shark Bay (鯊魚海灣) at 00:00. After clearing wave 10/10 and achieving victory at 03:37, they return to the Kingdom Hub to claim idle resources (03:42). The player then enters the Equipment menu at 03:46 to strengthen the Lion's Horn totem and carbon steel ring (03:51, 03:56). At 04:09, they pivot to Cooperative Mode (Rainbow Floors Level 2) after entering the Hall of Gameplay. Following a 6-minute battle starting at 05:01, they reach the Wave 10 boss but are defeated at 11:03, contributing only 28% of the team's total damage. The session concludes with the player returning to the equipment screen to address the power gap at 11:15.",
